{"h":3396,"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.033430232425720519,"x":0.80658436138572143,"c":1,"t":"Introduction","w":0.11522633870442711},{"w":0.32510286966959634,"c":1,"x":0.082304532156754817,"h":0.017506916756062751,"t":"HOW IS IELTS SCORED?","y":0.078488371929727796},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.080246912523029526,"c":1,"w":0.83950617472330735,"y":0.11773255799366189,"t":"ELTS results are reported on a nine-band scale. In addition to the score for overall language"},{"t":"ability, IELTS provides a score in the form of a profile for each of the four skills (Listening,","y":0.13403815763354265,"x":0.080196123211387568,"w":0.80875356038411461,"h":0.018602201598833523,"c":1},{"w":0.81275721232096354,"y":0.15253239096459348,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"t":"Reading, Writing and Speaking). These scores are also reported on a nine-band scale. All","x":0.082304521141987455},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.080246920718230308,"w":0.84156377156575513,"c":1,"y":0.17137809201400855,"t":"scores are recorded on the Test Report Form along with details of the candidate's nationality,"},{"w":0.78189300537109374,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"first language and date of birth. Each Overall Band Score corresponds to a descriptive","x":0.080246912783963092,"y":0.18895348823833169,"c":1},{"t":"statement which gives a summary of the English-language ability of a candidate classified at","h":0.01744185965530165,"x":0.080246923553642852,"c":1,"y":0.20494186065200037,"w":0.83744852701822914},{"h":0.016032884483202614,"t":"that level. The nine bands and their descriptive statements are as follows:","c":1,"x":0.080246921582807856,"y":0.2237926970504216,"w":0.66872426350911451},{"y":0.26889534856029607,"c":1,"w":0.018518517812093099,"t":"9","h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.0802469138134322},{"y":0.27031802123782067,"w":0.78189300537109374,"h":0.017472676590558844,"c":1,"x":0.11522633670136297,"t":"Expert user - Has fully operational command of the language: appropriate, accurate"},{"c":1,"x":0.1275720152427734,"w":0.36831275939941405,"t":"and fluent with complete understanding.","y":0.28916372229414877,"h":0.016195524146054074},{"x":0.1111111066151247,"w":0.80658437093098945,"h":0.016005492463128657,"y":0.31684334488775223,"c":1,"t":"Very good user - Has fully operational command of the language with only occasional"},{"t":"unsystematic inaccuracies and inappropriacies. Misunderstandings may occur in","w":0.73045267740885411,"x":0.1275720151169035,"h":0.016195524146054296,"y":0.33421672558294002,"c":1},{"x":0.12757200756987136,"t":"unfamiliar situations. Handles complex detailed argumentation well.","y":0.35174418590000001,"h":0.016041444524578563,"w":0.61316874186197912,"c":1},{"h":0.017667844522968101,"c":1,"x":0.12551439282926613,"y":0.3792697288554796,"t":"Good user - Has operational command of the language, though with occasional","w":0.73456792195638021},{"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings in some situations. Generally","h":0.017508628652008751,"x":0.12551439811289641,"y":0.39680232542103833,"w":0.75514404296874993,"c":1},{"w":0.62345677693684898,"h":0.015988372380376759,"x":0.12757202295441117,"c":1,"y":0.41569767427193383,"t":"handles complex language well and understands detailed reasoning."},{"c":1,"y":0.44016625062103465,"t":"Competent user - Has generally effective command of the language despite some","x":0.11514565751971124,"w":0.76971649169921863,"h":0.020372530035192016},{"c":1,"h":0.017441860778592888,"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings. Can use and understand fairly","x":0.12551440395925464,"y":0.45930232541124028,"w":0.76954732259114589},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"complex language, particularly in familiar situations.","x":0.12757200380157505,"c":1,"y":0.47819767427060667,"w":0.4711934407552083},{"w":0.79629628499348959,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"5 Modest user - Has partial command of the language, coping with overall meaning","x":0.080246919126306965,"y":0.50581395334256918},{"x":0.12545014734667093,"h":0.020381022117444081,"y":0.52084857907550053,"c":1,"t":"in most situations, though is likely to make many mistakes. Should be able to handle","w":0.7655763753255207},{"y":0.5406360426448934,"c":1,"w":0.31069959004720055,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.12551440241537815,"t":"basic communication in own field."},{"h":0.017952734786573998,"c":1,"w":0.76350677490234375,"x":0.080170887172090102,"t":"4 Limited user - Basic competence is limited to familiar situations. Has frequent","y":0.56766672867015788},{"c":1,"y":0.5871613662845131,"h":0.016036308275094724,"x":0.12757200598817234,"t":"problems in understanding and expression. Is not able to use complex language.","w":0.73456792195638021},{"h":0.018917603824107787,"c":1,"x":0.080246927590703579,"y":0.61189634903622658,"w":0.79629628499348959,"t":"3 Extremely limited user - Conveys and understands only general meaning in very"},{"c":1,"w":0.59876541137695316,"y":0.63221436956937616,"t":"familiar situations. Frequent breakdowns in communication occur.","h":0.016041444524578563,"x":0.12551441353367954},{"y":0.65843023277625379,"c":1,"w":0.018518517812093099,"h":0.015988371257085521,"t":"2","x":0.080246913804858808},{"t":"Intermittent user - Has great difficulty understanding spoken and written English.","y":0.65988372078432911,"w":0.77366256713867176,"h":0.015988372380376759,"x":0.10082303731801678,"c":1},{"y":0.68749999975015896,"w":0.010288065274556474,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"1","c":1,"x":0.084362140125067431},{"y":0.68749999985397892,"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.1275720232619767,"w":0.73251027425130211,"c":1,"t":"Non-user - Essentially has no ability to use the language beyond possibly a few"},{"x":0.12498191330506837,"w":0.1431662368774414,"h":0.017724391007170714,"y":0.70344387652433593,"t":"isolated words.","c":1},{"t":"Did not attempt the test - Did not answer the questions.","x":0.12551440757733001,"w":0.5267489624023437,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"y":0.73255813938777592},{"x":0.90740740722603508,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"7","y":0.9069767439376788,"w":0.014403292338053375,"c":1}]}